@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #FCE8E0
autonumber
participant "Unity session" as P0 <<boundary>>
participant "SessionUploadMapper" as P1 <<service>>
participant "DiskQueue" as P2 <<file store>>
participant "Uploader / BackendClient" as P3 <<service>>
participant "GameController" as P4 <<controller>>
P0 -> P4: Register installation and play session
P4 --> P0: Return solver assignment when available
P0 -> P0: Collect events and actual coordination plans
P0 -> P1: Finish and map final evidence once
P1 --> P0: Return stable final payload identities
P0 -> P2: Store final payload before sending
P3 -> P2: Read oldest pending payload
P2 --> P3: Return stable queued bytes
alt legacy file has no installation identity
P3 -> P2: Move it to rejected without sending
else current final payload
P3 -> P4: Submit final session evidence
P4 --> P3: Return accepted duplicate or rejected counts
note over P2,P4: Success clears the queued file; invalid data is set aside; network/auth/server failures stay queued.
end
@enduml